  "term": "witch doctor",
  "definition": "A witch doctor is a shaman or medicine man in certain traditional religious systems who is understood to oversee illness and its healing. In this context, healing is described as working through spiritual beliefs and psychologically influenced methods aimed at driving away disease-causing spirits.",
